     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nin June 2026, Michael Schaub and I are going to teach a 5-day Bayesian modeling workshop at the University of Debrecen, Hungary:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:14pt;color:rgb(200,38,19)\">\r\n<b><i>Bayesian occupancy, N-mixture and population modelling using NIMBLE and JAGS</i></b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThe workshop will contain a gentle introduction to Bayesian inference and computation, focusing on the two software products that we think currently have the best tradeoff between user-friendliness and power and flexibility. Thus, we will use JAGS and NIMBLE\r\n to fit and understand some of the most widely used models for the analysis of animal and plant populations. Models and topics include:</div>\r\n<div style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n </div>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nGLMs and generalized linear mixed models</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nSite-occupancy models</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nN-mixture models</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nState-space models</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nCormack-Jolly-Seber models</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nMultistate capture-recapture models</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nAdvanced use of NIMBLE (e.g. use of nimble functions, MCMC configuration)</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\nThe joy of data simulation</li><li style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0cm 46.35pt\">\r\n<div role=\"presentation\">General integrated and integrated population models (IPMs)</div>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDebrecen can be easily reached from the capital Budapest via public transport or rental car, and Hungary has very much indeed to offer for vacationers, both &#39;traditional&#39; and more bird or other nature-oriented. For instance, it is right next to the famous Hortobagy\r\n National Park.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nPlease send your application to Michael Schaub (<span style=\"color:blue\"><u><a style=\"color:blue\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a></u></span>), with\r\n cc to Zoltán Németh (<span style=\"color:blue\"><u><a style=\"color:blue\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a></u></span>), describing your background\r\n and knowledge in statistical modelling, R and NIMBLE/JAGS, by <b>25 February 2026 at the latest</b>.</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- M &amp; M</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"></span>_____________________________________________________________<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:0cm;margin-left:0px;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">Marc Kéry  ***** **<br>\r\n<a href=\"tel:+41%2041%20462%2097%2093\" value=\"+41414629793\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+41 41 462 97 93</a><br>\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.vogelwarte.ch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.vogelwarte.ch&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ucfOKwIL4sv0AAYliPS3X\">www.vogelwarte.ch</a><br>\r\nSwiss Ornithological Institute | Seerose 1 | CH-6204 Sempach | Switzerland<br>\r\n_____________________________________________________________<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">*** BOOKS: see <a href=\"http://www.hierarchicalmodels.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.hierarchicalmodels.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06XRB3_CCDFa6Jhm1XaW4S\">www.hierarchicalmodels.com</a>  ***</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n- BRAND NEW:    Kéry &amp; Kellner (2024): ASM - Applied Statistical Modeling for Ecologists, Elsevier</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">- Schaub &amp; Kéry (2022): IPM - Integrated Population Models, Academic Press<br>\r\n- Kéry &amp; Royle (2021): AHM2 - Applied hierarchical modeling in ecology, Vol. 2, Dynamic and advanced models, Academic Press</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">- Kéry &amp; Royle (2016): AHM1 - Applied hierarchical modeling in ecology, Vol. 1, Prelude and Static Models, Academic Press\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\">*** Hierarchical modeling workshops ***<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f=8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f%3D8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hqfNCZriVRLFEVTGIOxXC\">www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f=8</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, November 25, 2025 07:58<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> AW: Draft workshop announcement</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"DE-CH\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Zoltan,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Thank you very much! I have included your suggestions and now we have the announcement that can be spread (attached is a doxc and a pdf version).\r\n I will post it on <a href=\"http://www.phidot.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2OyM2DafFnsKsVUmJ-cyU8\">www.phidot.org</a> (I will send you the link later) and circulate it on the hmecology list. Please also use your cannels to advertise the workshop widely. Then we will see, how large is the interest.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">I have checked whether it is possible to install JAGS and NIMBLE on Linux, and according to the descriptions, this is possible for both. Though,\r\n Marc and I have no experience at all with Linux, so such users need to install the software on their own.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Best wishes</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Michael</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Montag, 24. November 2025 11:05<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Re: Draft workshop announcement</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Dear Michael and Marc,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Thanks again for the draft workshop announcement document. It looks great, we only added a couple of minor suggestions including my contact info as we would like to monitor how much interest there is for the\r\n workshop and be able to decide on time whether to advertise more. </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Question: Are JAGS and NIMBLE compatible with Linux? Quite a few researchers here work in that environment and do not have a laptop with  Windows OS.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Thanks again, </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Zoltan</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">---</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Zoltán Németh</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Department of Evolutionary Zoology and Human Biology</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">University of Debrecen</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Debrecen, Egyetem tér 1., 4032, Hungary</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:+36%2052%20512%20900\" value=\"+3652512900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(52)-512-900 ext. 62314</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Cell:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><a href=\"tel:+36%2030%20236%205608\" value=\"+36302365608\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(30)-236-5608</a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">    </span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"><a href=\"http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m%3DZoltan_Nemeth&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EoDV2yYkBZvseK4Lgm9q8\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth</span></a></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background:white\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"98%\" align=\"center\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 14, 2025 2:03 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> AW: Draft workshop announcement</span> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid #9c6500 1.0pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt;background:#ffeb9c\">\r\n<p style=\"background:#ffeb9c;border:none;padding:0cm\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">FIGYELEM:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> Ez a levél külső feladótól származik. Ne kattintson semmire a levélben, és ne nyissa meg a csatolmányt, amennyiben a küldő e-mail\r\n címét nem ismeri fel!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Perfect! Have a nice weekend as well!</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Best wishes</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-se