quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Department of Evolutionary Zoology and Human Biology</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">University of Debrecen</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Debrecen, Egyetem tér 1., 4032, Hungary</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:+36%2052%20512%20900\" value=\"+3652512900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(52)-512-900 ext. 62314</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Cell:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><a href=\"tel:+36%2030%20236%205608\" value=\"+36302365608\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(30)-236-5608</a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">    </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"><a href=\"http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m%3DZoltan_Nemeth&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EoDV2yYkBZvseK4Lgm9q8\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth</span></a></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background:white\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</span></a>4</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"98%\" align=\"center\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, November 12, 2025 6:23 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Draft workshop announcement</span> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid #9c6500 1.0pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\r\n<p style=\"background:#ffeb9c\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">FIGYELEM:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> Ez a levél külső feladótól származik. Ne kattintson semmire a levélben, és ne nyissa meg a csatolmányt, amennyiben a küldő e-mail címét nem ismeri fel!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Zoltan and Zoltan,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Please find attached our suggestion for the workshop advertisement. Could you please have a look and add your comments/suggestions?</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Thank you very much!</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Best wishes</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Michael</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Freitag, 10. Oktober 2025 11:14<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Re: Workshop budget</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Dear Michael, </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Thank you for your input. I attached a detailed budget in which you can see the individual items. Based on your input, and after talking with Zoltan, I also updated the registration fee calculations. Now, it\r\n includes 3 tiers for 4 categories. Please let us know what you and Marc think. We have organized workshops before with internationally known instructors and our experience is that Western EU participation is relatively low (despite the lower costs), that is\r\n why (i.e., to not further discourage participation, as well as for fairness) we would prefer not to set a large gap among the different categories. Of course, you and Marc may have other reasons and we are open for further modifications. </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Best wishes, </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Zoltan</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">---</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Zoltán Németh</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Department of Evolutionary Zoology and Human Biology</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">University of Debrecen</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Debrecen, Egyetem tér 1., 4032, Hungary</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:+36%2052%20512%20900\" value=\"+3652512900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(52)-512-900 ext. 62314</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Cell:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><a href=\"tel:+36%2030%20236%205608\" value=\"+36302365608\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(30)-236-5608</a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">    </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"><a href=\"http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m%3DZoltan_Nemeth&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EoDV2yYkBZvseK4Lgm9q8\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth</span></a></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background:white\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</span></a></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n<hr size=\"2\" width=\"98%\" align=\"center\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"> Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, October 9, 2025 6:26 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;; Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> AW: Workshop budget</span> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:solid #9c6500 1.0pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\r\n<p style=\"background:#ffeb9c\"><b><span style=\"color:black\">FIGYELEM:</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"> Ez a levél külső feladótól származik. Ne kattintson semmire a levélben, és ne nyissa meg a csatolmányt, amennyiben a küldő e-mail címét nem ismeri fel!</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Dear Zoltan,</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Thank you very much for this. Marc and I were wondering whether you have some details about the budget, i.e. some table where you have calculated\r\n it. For us this would be informative.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Regarding the workshop fees, we believe that we can (and should) charge participants from Western EU countries more. When we hold a workshop\r\n in Switzerland, we charge ~300 euros for students and ~600 euros for postdocs and above. Perhaps we could lower these prices slightly to reduce the difference between the Eastern and Western EU countries, but €200/€400 for students/postdocs seems appropriate\r\n to us (particularly since accommodation in Hungary is cheaper than in Western Europe). We also suggest lowering the price for Eastern EU participants to €50. If we then have 10 participants from the east and 10 from the west, the income will be at least €2,500,\r\n and Zoltan&#39;s losses will be smaller.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">What are your thoughts on this?</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Best wishes</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\">Michael</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Franklin Gothic Book&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n<p><b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Von:</span></b><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> Dr. Németh Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</a>&gt;\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Dienstag, 7. Oktober 2025 14:34<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> Marc Kery &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">marc...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Michael Schaub &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">michael...@vogelwarte.ch</a>&gt;; Dr. Barta Zoltán &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">zba...@unideb.hu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Workshop budget</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Dear All, </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Last time, we concluded our meeting with the agreement that us, local organizers, would come up with a preliminary budget by the end of September. </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">According to our calculations, the expected costs associated with the workshop will total around 4300 EUR, which includes room and catering costs for the workshop, as well as transport, accommodation, meals\r\n and per diem for Marc and Michael. </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">We propose a two-tier system for registration fees based on country of origin: 120 EUR for participants from Western EU countries and 60 EUR for Eastern EU ones.  We anticipate at least 10 participants from\r\n each of these regions, totalling  to approx. 1800 EUR. </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">The reamining costs will be covered by a grant from Zoltan Barta.  </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">We also talked about  a preliiminary round of advertising in December and a follow up in January or February with a final decision to be made about the feasibility (financial viability) of the workshop in\r\n late March/early April. </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Please let us know if this sounds reasonable and if you have any suggestions with regards to registration fee pricing or any other parts of the preparation.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Best wishes, </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">Zoltan</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\">  </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"color:black\"> </span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">---</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Zoltán Németh</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Department of Evolutionary Zoology and Human Biology</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">University of Debrecen</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Debrecen, Egyetem tér 1., 4032, Hungary</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:+36%2052%20512%20900\" value=\"+3652512900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(52)-512-900 ext. 62314</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">Cell:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#222222\"><a href=\"tel:+36%2030%20236%205608\" value=\"+36302365608\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+36-(30)-236-5608</a></span><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f1f1f\">    </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc\"><a href=\"http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m%3DZoltan_Nemeth&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492515004000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EoDV2yYkBZvseK4Lgm9q8\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">http://zoology.unideb.hu/?m=Zoltan_Nemeth</span></a></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background:white\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc\">nemeth...@science.unideb.hu</span></a></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
